    "proseDraft": "It was confirmed that Marcus sends the 4.2 release notes to Ingrid by Wednesday 2026-11-04 at 11:00 Central, which is 18:00 in Berlin. No unresolved items were listed, and the other comments about deadlines, grouping, and rollout remained only as stated remarks.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- It was confirmed by Ingrid, Marcus, and Priya with a passed recheck that Marcus sends the 4.2 release notes to Ingrid by Wednesday 2026-11-04 at 11:00 Central, which is 18:00 in Berlin.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- Someone requested the release notes by end of day tomorrow.\n- Someone said end of day tomorrow works.\n- Someone said they will group them by feature, fixes and deprecations.\n- Someone said they will review and publish them.\n- Someone asked to call out the export change.\n- Someone said they will put it at the top with a short how-to.\n- Someone said the rollout starts Thursday at 08:00 their time, with ten percent first.\n- Someone said they will have the help center drafts ready to flip on Thursday.\n- Someone asked to mention it in one line and link to the developer docs.\n- Someone said that works for them."
